WEBVTT

00:27:29.550 --> 00:27:31.176
and by moving his job online,

00:27:31.200 --> 00:27:35.416
JaBarie's been able to get clients
in San Francisco, Texas and Germany.

00:27:35.440 --> 00:27:37.173
JA: This is absolutely amazing now.

00:27:37.197 --> 00:27:40.246
It gives me a platform
to really showcase my talent.

00:27:40.270 --> 00:27:42.366
AG: Wait. Did you just say
this is amazing?

00:27:42.390 --> 00:27:45.805
JA: Yes, it allows you to interact
with your clients in a different way,

00:27:45.829 --> 00:27:47.556
and it builds trust,

00:27:47.580 --> 00:27:50.126
and it builds a bond
amongst people in your household.

00:27:50.150 --> 00:27:52.677
So, say your wife is cutting your hair.

00:27:52.701 --> 00:27:54.127
That's another level of trust

00:27:54.151 --> 00:27:55.789
because it's your hair, you know?

00:27:55.813 --> 00:27:58.006
AG: Wow, I would not have expected that.

00:27:58.030 --> 00:28:01.196
So it's gotta be harder, though,
to do your job in some ways,